Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:07.80,HeroTitle,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,450)\blur2.2}PERFECT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:07.80,HeroSub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,560)\blur1.8}ED SHEERAN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:13.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I found a love for me,\NDarling, just dive right in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:16.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}And follow my lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:24.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Well, I found a girl,\NBeautiful and sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:30.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Oh, I never knew you were the someone\NWaiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.40,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}'Cause we were just kids\NWhen we fell in love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:47.30,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Not knowing what it was,\NI will not give you up this time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.70,0:00:55.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Darling, just kiss me slow,\NYour heart is all I own
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:01:00.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}And in your eyes,\NYou're holding mine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:12.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\NWith you between my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:20.40,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Barefoot on the grass,\NListening to our favorite song
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:27.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}When you said you looked a mess,\NI whispered underneath my breath
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:35.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}But you heard it, darling,\NYou look perfect tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:47.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Well, I found a woman,\NStronger than anyone I know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:55.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}She shares my dreams,\NI hope that someday I'll share her home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:59.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I found a lover,\NTo carry more than just my secrets
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:04.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}To carry love,\NTo carry children of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:13.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}We are still kids, but we're so in love\NFighting against all odds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.80,0:02:19.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I know we'll be alright this time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:27.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Darling, just hold my hand,\NBe my girl, I'll be your man
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:35.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I see my future in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:51.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\NWith you between my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:58.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Barefoot on the grass,\NListening to our favorite song
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:05.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}When I saw you in that dress,\NLooking so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:15.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I don't deserve this, darling,\NYou look perfect tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:36.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\NWith you between my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:44.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Barefoot on the grass,\NListening to our favorite song
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:54.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I have faith in what I see,\NNow I know I have met an angel in person
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:59.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}And she looks perfect,\NI don't deserve this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:06.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}You look perfect tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:24.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}You look perfect tonight
